language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Place coins on an n by n grid, exactly c per row and per column, minimising the sum of squared horizontal distances of the coins from the main diagonal.
given n : int
given c : int
find x : matrix indexed by [int(1..n), int(1..n)] of bool
find z : int(0..1000000)

branching on [x]

minimising z
such that
$ in each row exactly c coins must be placed
forAll i : int(1..n) . (sum j : int(1..n) . x[i,j]) = c,
$ in each column exactly c coins must be placed
forAll j : int(1..n) . (sum i : int(1..n) . x[i,j]) = c,
$ z is the sum of the quadratic horizontal distance from the main diagonal over all cells containing a coin
z = (sum i : int(1..n) . (sum j : int(1..n) . x[i,j] * ((i-j)*(i-j))))
